<p>Returns the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/INVENTORY%20SLOT" title="INVENTORY SLOT *">INVENTORY_SLOT_*</a> constant for the inventory slot this item is equipped in, or the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/INVENTORY%20SLOT" title="INVENTORY SLOT *">INVENTORY_SLOT_INVALID</a> constant, if not equipped.
</p>
